            </a>
            </div>
            <div class="project-details">
                <h3>BucHunt Project</h3>
                <p>
                    BucHunt is a scavenger-hunt game that helps new ETSU students learn campus locations through gameplay.
                    Technologies: HTML, C#, CSS, JavaScript, SQL.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
